<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH NIOB CALLS 7.5 PCT 1990/99 BOND.</title>
<headline>DUTCH NIOB CALLS 7.5 PCT 1990/99 BOND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nederlandse Investeringsbank voor Ontwikkelingslanden NV (NIOB - Dutch investment bank for developing countries) said it planned to exercise the early redemption option on its 7.5 percent bond due 1990/99.</p>
<p>The bond, originally issued in 1984, will be redeemed at a price of 103.00 on December 15, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
